# Cavernous Maw: "{T}: Add {C}." and "{2}: This land becomes a 3/3 Elemental creature until end of turn. It's still a Cave land. Activate
# only if the number of other Caves you control plus the number of Cave cards in your graveyard is three or greater." With two other
# Captivating Caves it is refused (the Maw itself would make three, but it is not "other"); with the third it is offered, and two Caves
# tapped for {C} pay exactly its {2}. It is then a 3/3 Elemental that is still a Cave land, attacks for 3, and on the next turn is a
# plain land again (CR 613.1d, 613.4b, 611.2a, 602.5b).

